# Data: photos and tables live in Cloud Storage (gs://nasa-glazing-data), never in Git.
*.fits
*.fits.fz
*.fits.gz
*.parquet
/data/
/cache/
# Exception: small FITS cutouts in fixtures/fits/ for tests (keep each file small).
!fixtures/fits/*.fits
# web/public/data/ stays TRACKED: scripts/precompute and scripts/validate write it before the
# build, not during it, and Hosting deploys it from the repo (dev plan v2, Repo section).
